flowchart TB
  accTitle: C4 L2 - Workflow containers
  accDescr: The API, scheduled worker and explicit CLI compose the same PHP application. SQLite files are shared storage, not database servers. Every source effect uses the ordinary governance and recovery rules.
  Operator["Operator<br/>[Person]<br/>Browser review or explicit administration"]:::person
  subgraph Bridge["Support Bridge - workflow container view"]
    API["Operator API and browser review<br/>[Container: PHP 8.5 HTTP process]<br/>Authenticates requests and dispatches shared use cases"]:::container
    Worker["Scheduled worker<br/>[Container: PHP 8.5 process]<br/>Intake, fields, forward comments, then reverse notes"]:::container
    CLI["Administrative CLI<br/>[Container: on-demand PHP 8.5 process]<br/>Explicit commands, queries and private capture"]:::container
    Business[("Business state and required audit<br/>[Data-store container: live.sqlite]<br/>Pairs, plans, approvals, intake and independent note ledgers")]:::store
    Telemetry[("Diagnostic registry<br/>[Data-store container: metrics.sqlite]<br/>Best-effort counters and histograms")]:::store
  end
  Zendesk["Zendesk Support<br/>[External software system]<br/>Ticket fields and internal notes"]:::external
  GitHub["GitHub Issues<br/>[External software system]<br/>Issue fields and comments"]:::external

  Operator -->|"Chooses conflict sources and approves exact state plans<br/>HTTP, loopback 1988"| API
  Operator -->|"Runs authorized commands<br/>Linux shell / PHP CLI"| CLI
  API -->|"Commands and provider-free queries<br/>PDO SQLite; canonical file lock for commands"| Business
  Worker -->|"Persists intent, audit and verified results<br/>PDO SQLite; canonical file lock"| Business
  CLI -->|"Shares handlers, state and lock<br/>PDO SQLite / flock"| Business
  API -->|"Reads and records diagnostics<br/>SQLite"| Telemetry
  Worker -->|"Records best-effort observations<br/>SQLite"| Telemetry
  CLI -->|"Reads or records diagnostics<br/>SQLite"| Telemetry
  API -->|"Operator commands can read/write<br/>HTTPS REST; existing effect gates"| Zendesk
  API -->|"Operator commands can read/write<br/>HTTPS REST; existing effect gates"| GitHub
  Worker -->|"Polls and delivers eligible changes<br/>HTTPS REST"| Zendesk
  Worker -->|"Creates, reconciles and delivers<br/>HTTPS REST"| GitHub
  CLI -->|"Explicit provider commands only<br/>HTTPS REST"| Zendesk
  CLI -->|"Explicit provider commands only<br/>HTTPS REST"| GitHub

  Legend["Key: blue = executable container; green cylinder = persistent data store;<br/>grey = external system. Arrows name caller, purpose and technology.<br/>API queries and browser GET pages make no vendor requests; source-choice and approval submissions only read vendors."]:::key

